------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. PROJECT-SPECIFIC CLARIFICATIONS
------------------------------------------------------------------------
a. Demonstration Use: Within the GOTO project's own demonstration
   scenarios (local preview, GitHub Pages deployment, project
   screenshots, project documentation), the assets may be freely
   distributed and played back.

b. Social Media传播: Social media sharing of the project demo is
   permitted, provided that original authorship and source are
   preserved.

c. "火了算我的" Principle: If the project becomes popular, the
   authorship and credit remain with the original creators. Any viral
   spread must retain the original author declaration and source link.

d. Personal Modification: Users may modify the assets for personal use
   only. Modified versions MUST NOT be redistributed publicly. To share
   improvements, contribute to the source code instead (under AGPL-3.0)
   — the media assets themselves remain NoDerivatives.

e. Commercial Prohibition: 严禁 any form of commercial extraction,
   re-licensing,二次混音后发行, or unattributed redistribution.

------------------------------------------------------------------------
4. GOTO 宣传曲 (GOTO Theme Song) Slot
------------------------------------------------------------------------
The "GOTO 宣传曲" entry in playlist.json is a reserved slot
(slot: "easter_egg_2"). When a user binds an MP3 file to this slot,
the bound file inherits this CC BY-NC-ND 4.0 license automatically
and may not be extracted, redistributed, or used commercially outside
the GOTO project context.

